# Identifiers & Enumeration Reviewer Rule v1.0 STRICT

**Do not inline-audit.** Invoke **`identifier_enumeration_reviewer`** -> `.cursor/agents/identifier_enumeration_reviewer.md`.

## References

| Artifact | Path |
|---|---|
| Policy | `.cursor/skills/identifier_enumeration_reviewer/POLICY.md` |
| Scan skill | `.cursor/skills/identifier_enumeration_reviewer/SKILL.md` |
| Report path | `AI/identifier_enumeration_reviewer/identifier_enumeration_reviewer_report.md` |
| Report line | `identifier_enumeration_reviewer v1.0 STRICT` |

**POLICY.md wins.**

## Invoke when

Use before deploy or when entity ID fields, controller `@PathVariable` types, DTOs exposing identifiers, login/reset error messages, or search/list endpoints change.

Skip for generated output, `target/`, `node_modules/`, and docs-only edits unless the docs define identifier policy.

## Non-negotiable rules

1. **Exposing sequential integer PKs as the sole API identifier for user-owned resources is always FAIL.**
2. **Fetching a resource by ID without ownership/authorization check is always FAIL.**
3. **Different error messages for existing vs non-existing users on login/reset is always FAIL.**

